product.description:
3 meters long PVC round flexible ducting pipe. This air ducting hose is perfect for longer connections between duct fittings like wall grilles or duct joiners and extractor fans or any other ventilation systems.
Specifications:
- To connect 100mm or 4&quot; ducting fittings or extractor fans;
- To connect using jubilee clips or tie wraps;
- Expandable to 3 metre length;
- Flexible;
- Made from PVC;
- Suitable for temperatures up to 150C.

Basic PVC made round flexible ducting pipe 1 metre long. This air ducting hose is perfect for short connections between duct fittings like wall grilles or duct joiners and extractor fans or any other ventilation systems.
Specifications:
- To connect 100mm or 4&quot; ducting fittings or extractor fans;
- To connect using jubilee clips or tie wraps;
- Expandable to 1 metre length;
- Flexible;
- Made from PVC;
- Suitable for temperatures up to 150C.

